    "tacticalIdentity": "Contest a twin-channel estuary lock complex where hover packs and the amphibious Hydra MLRS-9 cruiser strike across flood basins while dry lock bridges, concrete control houses, and brick floodgate bulkheads give tracked armor cover and flanking cuts.",
